      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When you feel this heavy, the idea of \"moving forward\" sounds like an impossible demand, and I hear how exhausted you are by the pretense. If you are feeling like the struggle is too much, please know that there are people who want to support you through this immense pain. Reaching out to a crisis hotline or a mental health professional can offer immediate, non-judgmental support. Your life has inherent value, even when you cannot feel it right now.",
      "source": "target",
